  "description": "EF Core support (not ownership) for Dignite.Abp.FlexFields: EntityTypeBuilder extensions that map the value bag, a field definition and a query-index row onto a downstream's own entities, FlexFieldIndexBase<TEntity> and FlexFieldIndexValue (the typed pivot-table row shape - relational-only, with no MongoDb equivalent) for the downstream's per-host index table, EfCoreFlexFieldIndexManagerBase<TDbContext, TEntity, TIndex> to keep that table in sync, EfCoreFlexFieldQueryExecutorBase<TDbContext, TEntity, TIndex> to query it as a pushed-down SQL predicate, and EfCoreFlexFieldRepositoryBase<TDbContext, TField> for the downstream's field-definition entity. Ships no DbContext and no DbSet; every base class is abstract over the downstream's own DbContext interface and entity types, so the kernel still owns no concrete table. The downstream owns its DbContext, tables and migrations.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
